;  example_room  —  a small starter room.
;
;  "Double resolution": each SQUARE sits on an odd row and odd column, and the LINE
;  between two squares sits on the positions in between. Corners are '+'. Comment
;  lines start with ';'. Width and height (in characters) are both odd, minimum 3.
;
;  squares:  .  floor    ~  difficult ground    #  rock (blocks)    @  hero start (exactly one)
;            1-9  a numbered spawn slot (an encounter says who stands on each)
;  lines:    (space) open    |  wall up a line    -  wall along a line    x  shut door    +  corner

+-+-+-+-+-+
|@ . . 1 .|
+ + + + + +
|. .|~ . 3|
+ + + + + +
|. . . 2 .|
+-+-+-+-+-+
